# Feature folders

Every feature under `src/features/<feature>/` has the same folders as `src/features/cpq/`:

- `components/` for UI
- `config/` for JSON and other static configuration
- `db/` for one Supabase repository per table
- `hooks/` for custom React hooks
- `locales/` for UI copy
- `server/` for `queries.ts` and `actions.ts`
- `types/` for `index.ts` Zod schemas and inferred types
- `utils/` for pure functions

Do not add another top-level folder inside a feature. Do not put feature code outside these folders.

CRM is split into subfeatures under `src/features/crm/<subfeature>/`. Each subfeature uses the same folders: `components/`, `db/`, `locales/`, `server/`, `types/`, and `utils/`. `conversations`, `deals`, `customers`, `quotes`, `settings`, and `support` are the subfeatures that exist now. Code used by more than one of those subfeatures lives in `src/features/crm/common/` with the same folders.
